pinned': False, 'mention_everyone': False, 'tts': False, 'message_reference': {'type': 0, 'channel_id': '1522221412440342638', 'message_id': '1525140743151423559', 'guild_id': '1474094611029823508'}, 'position': 6, 'referenced_message': {'type': 0, 'content': 'My changes i want to make on the new system: \n\n- Just delete the star and  base stat from gametora completely, instead use an number system only have Speed Stamina and Power for easy calculation with the base is 9 max\n+ Is just mean you can choose to spent start point on Speed Stamina Power however you want, like 3-3-3 or 9-0-0 if you feel gambly\n||Might have some changes tho||\n+ Also mean there will be a new way to conculate race point now, i will cooking more if this is agreed\n\n- Because of that, there will NOT be a raw stat increase so new and old uma can fight fairly and roleplaying without "I just gonna loose anyway" => Training now is for appitude lv up. Like make uma Dirt G-F-E-D.... using dice system while training. (Can only train to B, from B to A need a G2+ win and S need a G1 win)\n\n+ Both trainers and umas have 15 rolls a day, each will roll 1d10 for diff out come\n<:sillyoguri:1468426296072601640> If matching number then the apptude will go up, if 1/1 then it will go down or get random debuff. If 10/10 the it will go up twice or get a random buff\n( Also also, uma need a trainer to sign up for G2 and above)\n<:dia_nowae:1491562188714803332>', 'mentions': [], 'mention_roles': [], 'attachments': [], 'embeds': [], 'timestamp': '2026-07-10T14:04:48.912000+00:00', 'edited_timestamp': '2026-07-10T14:16:32.206000+00:00', 'flags': 0, 'components': [], 'id': '1525140743151423559', 'channel_id': '1522221412440342638', 'author': {'id': '702862162925977671', 'username': 'kyoukoto', 'avatar': 'a7f1adf393bdb54b214f59a9e6f2a8ce', 'discriminator': '0', 'public_flags': 0, 'flags': 0, 'banner': None, 'accent_color': None, 'global_name': 'KyouKoto', 'avatar_decoration_data': {'asset': 'a_322c506cac670b3fc9915c44d1bcbe47', 'sku_id': '1459194821255237723', 'expires_at': None}, 'collectibles': {'nameplate': {'sku_id': '1409983105577783410', 'asset': 'nameplates/special_events_2/nitro_rocketfuel_nameplate/', 'label': 'COLLECTIBLES_SEPTEMBER_2025_MARKETING_NAMEPLATE_A11Y', 'palette': 'violet'}}, 'display_name_styles': None, 'banner_color': None, 'clan': {'identity_guild_id': '1284825998335934504', 'identity_enabled': True, 'tag': 'ᛖILF', 'badge': 'd9b61b27e595465e664933fa1c8fab66'}, 'primary_guild': {'identity_guild_id': '1284825998335934504', 'identity_enabled': True, 'tag': 'ᛖILF', 'badge': 'd9b61b27e595465e664933fa1c8fab66'}}, 'pinned': False, 'mention_everyone': False, 'tts': False, 'position': 5}}, {'type': 0, 'content': 'My changes i want to make on the new system: \n\n- Just delete the star and  base stat from gametora completely, instead use an number system only have Speed Stamina and Power for easy calculation with the base is 9 max\n+ Is just mean you can choose to spent start point on Speed Stamina Power however you want, like 3-3-3 or 9-0-0 if you feel gambly\n||Might have some changes tho||\n+ Also mean there will be a new way to conculate race point now, i will cooking more if this is agreed\n\n- Because of that, there will NOT be a raw stat increase so new and old uma can fight fairly and roleplaying without "I just gonna loose anyway" => Training now is for appitude lv up. Like make uma Dirt G-F-E-D.... using dice system while training. (Can only train to B, from B to A need a G2+ win and S need a G1 win)\n\n+ Both trainers and umas have 15 rolls a day, each will roll 1d10 for diff out come\n<:sillyoguri:1468426296072601640> If matching number then the apptude will go up, if 1/1 then it will go down or get random debuff. If 10/10 the it will go up twice or get a random buff\n( Also also, uma need a trainer to sign up for G2 and above)\n<:dia_nowae:1491562188714803332>', 'mentions': [], 'mention_roles': [], 'attachments': [], 'embeds': [], 'timestamp': '202